# API Gateway Pattern
  - Sits between Client and Server.
  - Serves as reverse proxy for microservices so client does not need to know actual address.
  - Common tasks such as authentication, routing and distribution is done in API gateway.
    So internal mapping can change but enteral endpoints can remain same.
  - Ratelimiting and loadbalancing can also be part of API gateway.

